<xml xmlns="https://bipes.net.br">
  <workspace><field name="DEVICE">FEATHER_S3_MPY</field></workspace>
  <variables><variable id="var_start">start</variable><variable id="var_sent">sent</variable><variable id="var_status">status</variable><variable id="var_pics">pics</variable><variable id="var_n">n</variable><variable id="var_until">until</variable><variable id="var_msg">msg</variable><variable id="var_rssi">rssi</variable><variable id="var_snr">snr</variable><variable id="var_line">line</variable><variable id="var_typed">typed</variable></variables>
  <block type="procedures_callnoreturn" id="b8" x="10" y="10"><mutation name="get ready"></mutation><next><block type="hippa_forever" id="b7"><comment pinned="false" h="330" w="380">HippaFone messages, made of blocks. It sends "S3 handset online" a few seconds after it starts, shows every radio message it hears (with the signal strength when there is a reading) and flashes the light green, sends whatever you type on a keyboard, and shows the words you are typing on the bottom line.

Pressing the BOOT button sends "hello from HippaFone handset". The finished HippaFone program uses its D1 and D2 buttons for this, but the big screen covers them, so BOOT does it here.

Pictures: tap the screen anywhere to show the next picture from the SD card. A tap after the last picture brings the messages back, and so does waiting 40 seconds. With no SD card a tap does nothing.

The blocks cannot do two things the finished HippaFone program does: the start-up logo, and the logo button and home button drawn in the corner of the screen. Here a tap anywhere steps to the next picture.</comment><statement name="DO"><block type="procedures_callnoreturn" id="b1"><mutation name="say hello once"></mutation><next><block type="procedures_callnoreturn" id="b2"><mutation name="check the radio"></mutation><next><block type="procedures_callnoreturn" id="b3"><mutation name="send what I typed"></mutation><next><block type="procedures_callnoreturn" id="b4"><mutation name="check the Boot button"></mutation><next><block type="procedures_callnoreturn" id="b5"><mutation name="next picture on tap"></mutation><next><block type="procedures_callnoreturn" id="b6"><mutation name="back to messages"></mutation></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></statement></block></next></block>
  <block type="procedures_defnoreturn" id="b28" x="10" y="400"><comment pinned="false" h="80" w="200">Sets the variables the other functions share, turns the Bluetooth keyboard on and shows the title.</comment><field name="NAME">get ready</field><statement name="STACK"><block type="variables_set" id="b10"><field name="VAR" id="var_start">start</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="hippa_now" id="b9"></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b12"><field name="VAR" id="var_sent">sent</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="logic_boolean" id="b11"><field name="BOOL">FALSE</field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b14"><field name="VAR" id="var_status">status</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="text" id="b13"><field name="TEXT"></field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b16"><field name="VAR" id="var_pics">pics</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="hippa_picture_list" id="b15"></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b18"><field name="VAR" id="var_n">n</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_number" id="b17"><field name="NUM">0</field></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b20"><field name="VAR" id="var_until">until</field><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_number" id="b19"><field name="NUM">0</field></block></value><next><block type="hippa_bluetooth_keyboard_on" id="b21"><next><block type="hippa_screen_title" id="b23"><value name="TEXT"><block type="text" id="b22"><field name="TEXT">HippaFone handset</field></block></value><next><block type="hippa_screen_write" id="b25"><value name="TEXT"><block type="text" id="b24"><field name="TEXT">ready</field></block></value><next><block type="hippa_screen_status" id="b27"><value name="TEXT"><block type="variables_get" id="b26"><field name="VAR" id="var_status">status</field></block></value></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></state